  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Government and Civil Society Capacity to Prevent Violent Extremism in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to increase Government and civil society capacity to prevent violent extremism in Iraq through targeted support in the implementation and the establishment of policy feedback loops on national and subnational level, seeking to strengthen future iterations of the National Prevention of Violent Extremism Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
